WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.654
This is InForm.

2
00:00:01.654 --> 00:00:06.298
A Microsoft Word add-in that checks
your APA 7 formatting, and then checks

3
00:00:06.298 --> 00:00:08.461
the sources behind your citations.

4
00:00:09.011 --> 00:00:13.124
It lives in the Word task pane, beside
the paper you are already writing.

5
00:00:13.124 --> 00:00:15.980
Nothing is added to your
document until you say so.

6
00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:18.266
One press checks the whole thing.

7
00:00:18.616 --> 00:00:22.888
It comes back with everything closed,
so you choose where to look first.

8
00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:25.776
Formatting and citations.
Reference verification.

9
00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:27.761
And a feedback summary to export.

10
00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:32.209
Open the formatting section, and
the findings are already sorted.

11
00:00:32.209 --> 00:00:35.601
Not by what kind they are,
but by how certain InForm is.

12
00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.328
Ready to insert.
Check first.

13
00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:38.500
Judge for yourself.

14
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.058
Open a rule and it names the problem,
explains the principle behind it, shows

15
00:00:43.058 --> 00:00:46.903
you the entry it means, and takes you
straight to that spot in the paper.

16
00:00:47.403 --> 00:00:49.963
Then the part a formatting
checker cannot do.

17
00:00:49.963 --> 00:00:53.162
Every reference is looked up
in bibliographic databases.

18
00:00:53.162 --> 00:00:57.177
Works that have been retracted.
Details that disagree with the record.

19
00:00:57.177 --> 00:01:00.900
Links that no longer resolve.
And the ones that simply check out.

20
00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:03.569
And you never have to take its word for it.

21
00:01:03.569 --> 00:01:06.252
What Was Checked opens the
evidence behind a verdict.

22
00:01:06.252 --> 00:01:08.729
Which sources answered,
what they said, and when.

23
00:01:09.229 --> 00:01:12.253
Tick what you want, and InForm
writes it into the paper as

24
00:01:12.253 --> 00:01:15.435
Word comments, under your name.
It never rewrites a sentence.

25
00:01:15.435 --> 00:01:18.353
It shows you what to change,
and leaves the call to you.

26
00:01:18.853 --> 00:01:23.081
Whatever stays out of the paper can
still be exported as a feedback summary,

27
00:01:23.081 --> 00:01:24.885
next to a student-facing report.

28
00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:27.241
The checks run on your own machine.

29
00:01:27.241 --> 00:01:31.005
InForm does not upload your document,
and it does not keep your writing.

30
00:01:31.555 --> 00:01:35.035
InForm, from ScholarVera.
On Microsoft AppSource now.

31
00:01:35.035 --> 00:01:37.176
Your first four months are free.
